diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b645c68..4fae70c 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1 +1,78 @@
 # lilith
+
+A wlroots-based Wayland compositor: floating windows on an endless zoomable
+canvas, with a built-in status bar.
+
+| red | painting |
+| --- | --- |
+| ![red](screenshots/red.png) | ![painting](screenshots/painting.png) |
+| **sky** | **field** |
+| ![sky](screenshots/sky.png) | ![field](screenshots/field.jpg) |
+
+## How it works
+
+Windows are **free-floating** — drag them anywhere on an infinite canvas,
+zoom the whole canvas with the scroll wheel, snap them to each other while
+dragging. No tiling unless you want it.
+
+Everything follows **one pywal16 palette**. Pick a wallpaper image, and the
+colours change everywhere at once: compositor borders, built-in bar, terminal,
+GTK and Qt apps, dunst.
+
+The wallpaper is drawn by `swaybg` (not the compositor), and the config
+compiles the current palette into the binary — so after changing the palette
+you restart lilith once and everything is the new colour.
+
+## Packages
+
+Build (Arch/Artix names):
+
+```
+base-devel wlroots0.19 libinput libxkbcommon libdrm fcft pixman xorg-server-xwayland xcb-util-wm
+```
+
+Runtime (pywal16 is in the AUR):
+
+```
+pywal16 foot wmenu dunst swaybg swayidle swaylock cliphist wl-clipboard grim slurp brightnessctl polkit-gnome yambar qt6ct ttf-nerd-fonts-symbols
+```
+
+Also used by the author's own scripts (`~/.local/bin`, not in this repo):
+`btop`, `tty-clock`, `yazi`, the Gallant Raster Term font.
+
+## Install
+
+```
+git clone https://github.com/ohto121/lilith
+cd lilith
+make
+./lilith    # from a TTY, after logging in
+```
+
+The rice (the colours, keybinds and the bar) is on the `rice` branch; `main`
+has the upstream defaults.
+
+## Usage
+
+- `wal-lilith <image>` — pick a wallpaper; the palette is generated from it,
+  everything recolours and lilith rebuilds. Restart lilith to apply.
+- `wal -R -n` — regenerate the palette files without touching the wallpaper.
+- Win+Shift+Q — quit; log in again to start a fresh session.
+
+## Keys (default)
+
+- **Win+Q** terminal, **Win+R** launcher, **Win+C** close, **Win+F** fullscreen
+- **Win+Shift+F/H/T/B/D** browser / telegram / btop / clock
+- **Win+Z** zoom to fit all windows, **Win+=** / **Win+-** canvas zoom
+- **Win+WASD** move focus, **Win+Tab** center a window, **Win+Home** canvas home
+- **Win+1..9** tags, **Win+B** toggle the bar, **Win+L** lock
+- Print / **Win+Shift+S** screenshots, **Win+V** clipboard history
+- Left-drag on the canvas pans it, **Win+left-drag** moves a window,
+  **Win+right-drag** resizes, scroll zooms.
+
+See `config/` for everything: every option has a comment.
+
+## Licenses
+
+MIT for lilith, GPL-style licenses for the parts inherited from dwl/dwm/sway
+and tinywl — see the LICENSE* files.
